# Smack with the emulated controllers (--usb launchpad): Launchpad top 1
# CAPTURE, a held pad on rows 1-4 punches (green while held), a held
# Haute42 button punches too (B2 white).
#!args --usb launchpad
wait 4500
sing 220
wait 8000                  # longer than LENGTH steps, so the loop is all voice
lp top 1 press             # CAPTURE (hold, like B1's > 0.6 s)
wait 900
lp top 1 release
wait 600
print leds
expect led b1 green        # looping
lp press 2 1               # hold a punch effect pad
wait 300
expect lp 2 1 green
expect led b1 white        # punching
lp release 2 1
wait 300
expect led b1 green
pad a press                # a Haute42 button
wait 300
expect led b2 white
pad a release
wait 300
silence
wait 500
mark
wait 3000
expect rms > 0.005         # the captured loop, over 3 s
